    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mawatho Makoniĩ Mĩrimũ ya Ngoothi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ Jehova akĩĩra Musa na Harũni atĩrĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũndũ o wothe angĩgĩa na handũ haimbu, kana mũtũnda, kana handũ hakaragacũku ngoothi-inĩ yake, harĩa hangĩtuĩka mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio-rĩ, no nginya atwarwo kũrĩ Harũni, ũrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai, kana kũrĩ ũmwe wa ariũ ake ũrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai arore kĩronda kĩu kĩrĩ ngoothi-inĩ yake, na angĩkorwo njuĩrĩ ya handũ hau harũaru nĩĩgarũrũkĩte ĩkerũha, na kĩronda kĩu kĩonwo kĩrikĩire thĩinĩ wa mwĩrĩ gũkĩra harĩa ngoothi yakinya-rĩ, ũcio nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio. Nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai aarĩkia kũmũrora, nĩagacooka atue atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angĩkorwo kĩmeni kĩu arĩ nakĩo ngoothi-inĩ yake nĩkĩerũhĩte na gĩtirikĩire ngoothi-inĩ, nayo njuĩrĩ yaho ndĩerũhĩte-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakaiga mũndũ ũcio mũrũaru handũ mwanya mĩthenya mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũrora na angĩkoona atĩ kĩronda gĩtigarũrũkĩte na gĩtithegeete-rĩ, nĩakamũiga handũ mwanya mĩthenya ĩngĩ mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai, nĩakamũrora o rĩngĩ, na angĩkorwo kĩronda kĩu nĩkĩrathira na gĩtithegeete ngoothi-inĩ-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu; ĩyo no mĩtũnda. Mũndũ ũcio no nginya athambie nguo ciake, nake nĩagathera, athirwo nĩ thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mũtũnda ũcio ũngĩthegea ngoothi-inĩ yake thuutha wa kwĩonania harĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai, nĩguo atuĩke ndarĩ na thaahu, no nginya acooke kũrĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai rĩngĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakamũrora, na angĩkorwo mũtũnda ũthegeete ngoothi-inĩ, nĩakamũtua atĩ arĩ na thaahu; ũcio nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũrĩa ũngĩgwatanio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rĩrĩa mũndũ o wothe angĩgĩa na mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio-rĩ, no nginya atwarwo harĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũrora, na hangĩkorwo harĩ na handũ haimbu hakeerũha ngoothi-inĩ hagatũma njuĩrĩ yerũhe, na angĩkorwo handũ hau haimbu nĩhatũrĩkĩte hakagĩa kĩronda-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ũcio nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũtangĩhona, nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu. Ndakamũiga handũ mwanya, tondũ mũndũ ũcio nĩarĩkĩtie kũgĩa na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“No rĩrĩ, mũrimũ ũcio ũngĩhunja ngoothi-inĩ yake yothe, na harĩa hothe mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩhota kuona oone atĩ mũrimũ ũcio ũiyũrĩte ngoothi-inĩ ya mũndũ ũcio mũrũaru kuuma mũtwe nginya magũrũ-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakamũrora, na aakorwo mũrimũ ũcio nĩ ũiyũrĩte mwĩrĩ wake wothe, nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu. Kuona atĩ nĩerũhĩte kũndũ guothe-rĩ, ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No hĩndĩ ĩrĩa yothe mũndũ ũcio angĩonwo arĩ na ironda-rĩ, nĩagatuĩka arĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rĩrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩona kĩronda-rĩ, nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu. Kĩronda kĩu kĩrĩ na thaahu; mũndũ ũcio arĩ na mũrimũ ũngĩgwatanio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No kĩronda kĩu kĩngĩgarũrũka kĩerũhe, no nginya mũndũ ũcio athiĩ harĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakamũrora, na aakorwo ironda nĩcierũhĩte-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio mũrũaru ndarĩ na thaahu, nake nĩagatuĩka ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rĩrĩa mũndũ angĩgĩa na ihũha ngoothi-inĩ yake na rĩcooke rĩhone,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naho hau ihũha rĩraarĩ haimbe na herũhe, kana hagĩe na kameni gatune-rĩ, no nginya athiĩ akeyonanie kũrĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakarora handũ hau, na hangĩoneka nĩ harikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi, na njuĩrĩ ciaho ikerũha, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu. Nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio ũtuthũkĩte harĩa ihũha rĩu rĩraarĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩrora handũ hau one hatirĩ na njuĩrĩ njerũ thĩinĩ waho, na hatirikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi, na nĩhahohete-rĩ, hĩndĩ ĩyo mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũiga handũ mwanya ihinda rĩa mĩthenya mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kũngĩkorwo kĩronda kĩa ihũha rĩu nĩkĩrathegea ngoothi-inĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu; ũcio nĩ mũrimũ ũngĩgwatanio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No handũ hau hangĩkorwo hatigarũrũkĩte na hatithegeete, kĩu no kĩrema kĩa ihũha, nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mũndũ angĩgĩa na ihĩa ngoothi-inĩ yake, narĩo ihĩa rĩu rĩgĩe na kĩronda gĩtunĩhe kana kĩerũhe-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakarora handũ hau, na angĩkorwo njuĩrĩ ciaho nĩcierũhĩte, na hakorwo hakĩoneka harikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi-rĩ, ũcio nĩ mũrimũ ũngĩgwatanio ũtũrĩkĩire ihĩa-inĩ rĩu. Nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu; ũcio nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩkaarora one atĩ hatirĩ na njuĩrĩ njerũ kĩrema-inĩ kĩu na ti harikĩru gũkĩra ngoothi yake na nĩhahohete-rĩ, thuutha ũcio mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũiga handũ mwanya mĩthenya mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũrora rĩngĩ, naguo mũrimũ ũcio ũngĩkorwo nĩũrathegea ngoothi-inĩ-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu; ũcio nĩ mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No handũ hau hangĩkorwo hatigarũrũkĩte, na hatithegeete ngoothi-inĩ, no nĩhahohete, ũcio nĩ ũimbu wa ihĩa rĩu, nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu; kĩu no kĩrema kĩa ihĩa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mũndũ mũrũme kana mũndũ-wa-nja angĩkorwo na kĩronda mũtwe kana kĩreru-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakarora kĩronda kĩu, na kĩngĩoneka kĩrikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi, nayo njuĩrĩ yaho ĩkorwo nĩ ya rangi wa ngoikoni, na ĩkorwo ĩrĩ njeke, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu; ũcio nĩ ũhere, nĩ mũrimũ wa mangũ ma mũtwe kana ma kĩreru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩrora kĩronda kĩa mũthemba ũcio, na gĩkorwo ti kĩrikĩru gũkĩra ngoothi, na hatirĩ njuĩrĩ njirũ thĩinĩ wakĩo, hĩndĩ ĩyo mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakaiga mũndũ ũcio mũrũaru handũ mwanya mĩthenya mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakarora kĩronda kĩu rĩngĩ na angĩkorwo ũhere ũcio ndũthegeete na hatirĩ njuĩrĩ cia rangi wa ngoikoni, na gĩtikuoneka kĩrikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no nginya mũndũ ũcio enjwo tiga o harĩa harũaru, nake mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũiga handũ mwanya mĩthenya ĩngĩ mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakarora ũhere ũcio o rĩngĩ, na angĩkorwo ndũthegeete ngoothi-inĩ na ndũkuoneka ũrikĩire gũkĩra ngoothi-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩagatua atĩ mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu. No no nginya athambie nguo ciake, na nĩagatuĩka ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No, ũhere ũcio, ũngĩthegea ngoothi-inĩ thuutha wa mũndũ ũcio gũtuuo atĩ ndarĩ na thaahu-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio nĩakamũrora na angĩkorwo ũhere ũcio nĩũthegeete ngoothi-inĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio ndakabatario nĩkũrora njuĩrĩ cia rangi wa ngoikoni; mũndũ ũcio arĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩkoona atĩ hatirĩ na ũgarũrũku na nĩhamerete njuĩrĩ njirũ, ũhere ũcio nĩũhonete. Mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu, nake Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũtua ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũndũ mũrũme kana mũndũ-wa-nja angĩgĩa na tũmeni twerũ ngoothi-inĩ-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagatũrora, na tuo tũngĩkorwo ti twerũ mũno-rĩ, ũcio nĩ mũtũnda ũtangĩrwaria mũndũ ũtuthũkĩte ngoothi-inĩ; mũndũ ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũndũ angĩmunyũka njuĩrĩ na agĩe na kĩhara-rĩ, ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angĩkorwo amunyũkĩte njuĩrĩ ĩrutĩtie na thiithi akagĩa kĩhara kĩa na mbere, ũcio ndarĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No angĩkorwo arĩ na kĩronda gĩtune kĩhara-inĩ kana thiithi-inĩ wake-rĩ, ũcio nĩ mũrimũ ũngĩgwatanio ũratuthũka kĩhara-inĩ kana thiithi-inĩ wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũrora, na angĩkorwo kĩronda kĩu kĩimbĩte kĩhara-inĩ kana thiithi-inĩ nĩ gĩtune gĩkahaana ta mũrimũ wa ngoothi ũngĩgwatanio-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mũndũ ũcio nĩ mũrũaru na arĩ na thaahu. Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakamũtua arĩ na thaahu nĩ ũndũ wa kĩronda kĩu kĩrĩ mũtwe wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mũndũ ũrĩ na mũrimũ ta ũcio ũngĩgwatanio-rĩ, no nginya ehumbe nguo ndarũku, na arekererie njuĩrĩ yake, na ahumbĩre kanua gake, athiĩ akĩanagĩrĩra akiugaga atĩrĩ, ‘Ndĩ na thaahu! Ndĩ na thaahu!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rĩrĩa rĩothe mũndũ ũcio arĩ na mũrimũ ũcio, arĩkoragwo arĩ na thaahu. No nginya atũũrage wiki, na no nginya atũũrage nja ya kambĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mawatho Makoniĩ Ũgumu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nguo o na ĩrĩkũ ĩngĩguma, ĩrĩ ya guoya wa ngʼondu kana ya gatani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kana ya taama o wothe ũtumĩtwo na ndigi njogothe kana taama wa gatani, kana guoya wa ngʼondu, kana rũũa o ruothe, kana kĩndũ o gĩothe gĩthondeketwo na rũũa-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na angĩkorwo ũgumu ũcio ũrĩ nguo-inĩ, kana rũũa-inĩ, kana taama-inĩ wa ndigi njogothe, kana taama-inĩ o wothe mũtume, kana kĩndũ-inĩ o gĩothe gĩtumĩtwo na rũũa-rĩ, ũgumu ũcio ũngĩkorwo na rangi ta wa nyeki nduru kana mũtune, ũcio nĩ ũgumu ũrathegea, na no nginya wonio mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakarora ũgumu ũcio, na aige kĩndũ kĩu kĩrĩ na ũgumu handũ mwanya mĩthenya mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya wa mũgwanja nĩakarora kĩndũ kĩu, na angĩkorwo ũgumu ũcio nĩũthegeete nguo-inĩ, kana ndigi-inĩ njogothe, kana taama-inĩ mũtume, kana rũũa-inĩ, rũrĩ rwa kũrutĩrwo wĩra o na ũrĩkũ, ũcio nĩ ũgumu wa kwananga; kĩndũ kĩu kĩrĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No nginya acine nguo ĩyo, kana ndigi icio njogothe, kana taama ũcio mũtume na guoya wa ngʼondu kana gatani, kana kĩndũ kĩngĩ gĩothe kĩa rũũa rũrĩa rũgwatie ũgumu ũcio, nĩ ũndũ ũgumu ũcio nĩ wa kwananga; kĩndũ kĩu no nginya gĩcinwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“No rĩrĩ, rĩrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩrora kĩndũ kĩu, ũgumu ũcio ũkorwo ndũthegeete nguo-inĩ ĩyo, kana ndigi-inĩ icio njogothe kana taama-inĩ ũcio mũtume, kana kĩndũ kĩa rũũa-rĩ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nĩagaathana kĩndũ kĩu kĩgwatĩtio ũgumu gĩthambio. Ningĩ nĩagakĩiga handũ mwanya mĩthenya ĩngĩ mũgwanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thuutha wa kĩndũ kĩu kĩgwatie ũgumu gũthambio-rĩ, mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩagakĩrora, na angĩkorwo ũgumu ũcio ndũrĩ ũndũ ũgarũrũkĩte, o na gũtuĩka ndũthegeete-rĩ, kĩndũ kĩu kĩrĩ na thaahu. Nĩgĩcinwo na mwaki, o na aakorwo ũgumu ũnyiitĩte mwena ũmwe kana ũrĩa ũngĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai angĩrora kĩndũ kĩu na akore ũgumu ũcio ũnyihanyiihĩte thuutha wa kĩndũ kĩu gũthambio-rĩ, nĩagatembũra nguo ĩyo eherie hau he na ũgumu kuuma nguo-inĩ ĩyo, kana rũũa-inĩ, kana ndigi-inĩ icio njogothe, kana taama-inĩ ũcio mũtume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No ũgumu ũcio ũngĩcooka woneke nguo-inĩ, kana harĩ ndigi icio njogothe, kana taama ũcio mũtume, kana kĩndũ kĩa rũũa, ũgumu ũcio nĩgũthegea ũrathegea, na kĩrĩa gĩothe kĩrĩ na ũgumu ũcio no nginya gĩcinwo na mwaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguo ĩyo, kana ndigi icio njogothe, kana taama mũtume, kana kĩndũ kĩa rũũa kĩrĩa gĩthambĩtio gĩkaniinwo ũgumu ũcio no nginya gĩthambio rĩngĩ, na nĩ gĩgaathirwo nĩ thaahu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macio nĩmo mawatho marĩa makoniĩ indo inyiitĩtwo nĩ ũgumu, irĩ cia guoya wa ngʼondu, kana taama wa gatani, kana ndigi njogothe, kana taama mũtume, kana kĩndũ o gĩothe kĩa rũũa, nĩmo mawatho ma gũtua kana indo icio irĩ na thaahu kana itirĩ na thaahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
